sequenceDiagram
    participant WP as Webpack 内核 (Core)
    participant Parser as Parser 解析器
    participant Graph as ModuleGraph
    participant Chunk as ChunkGraph
    participant Split as SplitChunksPlugin
    participant Final as 最终 Chunk
    participant Output as 文件输出

    Note over WP,Chunk: 阶段一：Webpack 内核 — 动态 import() 自动创建 Chunk 边界
    Note over WP,Chunk: （此阶段与 SplitChunksPlugin 完全无关）

    WP->>Parser: 从 index.jsx 开始解析
    Parser->>Graph: 遇到静态 import → 递归解析依赖
    Parser->>Parser: 遇到动态 import('Home.jsx')...

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Parser,Chunk: Webpack Core 自动：每个 import() 创建一个独立的 Async Chunk
        Parser->>Chunk: 🆕 创建 async chunk: Home.async
        Parser->>Chunk: 🆕 创建 async chunk: ProductList.async
        Parser->>Chunk: 🆕 创建 async chunk: OrderList.async
        Parser->>Chunk: 🆕 创建 async chunk: Dashboard.async
        Parser->>Chunk: entry.chunk (initial)
        Chunk->>Chunk: 将各个模块分配到所属 Chunk
    end

    Note over Chunk: 此时已存在 5 个 Chunk<br/>Webpack Core 完成了模块→Chunk 的初次分配<br/>react 等公共模块被重复分配到多个 Chunk 中

    Note over WP,Chunk: 阶段二：SplitChunksPlugin 介入 — 跨 Chunk 去重

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Split,Final: SplitChunksPlugin 只在已有 Chunk 之上做"查重→提取"
        Split->>Split: 遍历所有模块，统计"该模块出现在哪些 Chunk 中"
        Split->>Split: react → 5个 Chunk → 提取
        Split->>Split: lodash → 3个 Chunk → 提取
        Split->>Split: Table → 2个 Chunk → 提取
        Split->>Split: format.js → 1个 Chunk → 不提取
        Split->>Split: 应用 minChunks/minSize/cacheGroups 条件
        Split->>Final: 创建新 Chunk (vendor / common)
        Split->>Final: 从原 Chunk 中删除已被提取的模块
    end

    Final->>Output: vendor.js [react+react-dom+lodash] ← 新增
    Final->>Output: common.js [Table+request.js]       ← 新增
    Final->>Output: entry.chunk (Layout 只剩 Layout.jsx)
    Final->>Output: Home.async (只剩 Home.jsx + format.js)
    Final->>Output: ProductList.async (只剩 ProductList.jsx)
    Final->>Output: OrderList.async (只剩 OrderList.jsx)
    Final->>Output: Dashboard.async (只剩 Dashboard.jsx)
